s/Teviz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Teviz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Teviz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Teviz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Teviz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Teviz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Teviz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Teviz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2017-03-30T15:35:04Z","updated_at":"2017-03-30T15:35:04Z","body":"ok, sorry for that.\r\n### Issue description\r\nWhen prepare some FLV videos, the player fails with ParserException.\r\nI found the direct reason is that the metadata tag of FLV video is AMF_TYPE_OBJECT but not AMF_TYPE_ECMA_ARRAY.For more is out of my knowledge.\r\n\r\n### Reproduction steps\r\nUsing ExoPlayer demo app and replace the video url as I sent.\r\n\r\n### Link to test content\r\nIn the mail I sent.\r\n\r\n### Version of ExoPlayer being used\r\n2.2.0\r\n\r\n### Device(s) and version(s) of Android being used\r\nany Android OS Device I used.\r\ne.g Nexus 5X emulator.\r\nit reproduces every time.\r\n\r\n### A full bug report captured from the device\r\nIn the mail I sent.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/290449359/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"Teviz","id":26684819,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2Njg0ODE5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26684819?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Teviz","html_url":"https://github.com/Teviz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Teviz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Teviz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"h